# "When Mjölnir enters, it deals 4 damage to up to one target creature": the target is chosen as the trigger is put on the stack
# (CR 603.3d). Bot2 answers by exiling its own Belladonna Took with Swords to Plowshares, so the target is gone when the trigger
# resolves (CR 608.2b): it does nothing, and the 4 damage is not redirected to anything else. Bot2 gains 2 (Belladonna's power).

